flowchart TD
  accTitle: Worker-uplift telemetry scope decision flow
  accDescr {
    The diagram starts with the approved worker-uplift telemetry scope, splits it into
    required metrics and logs, deferred traces and exemplars, and forbidden profiles and
    payload telemetry, then shows that metrics and logs go to Grafana Cloud with bounded
    labels, while the policy also enforces quota guardrails, rollback switches, and privacy
    limits.
  }
  A[Worker-uplift telemetry scope approved] --> B[Required: metrics and structured logs]
  A --> C[Deferred: traces and exemplars]
  A --> D[Forbidden: profiles and payload telemetry]
  B --> E[Metrics to Grafana Cloud Metrics]
  B --> F[Logs to Grafana Cloud Logs]
  C --> G[No Tempo, OTLP, or trace credentials now]
  D --> H[No article, model, or secret data in telemetry]
  E --> I[Bounded labels and queue/service coverage]
  F --> I
  I --> J[Quota guardrails, rollback switches, and privacy boundary]
